content.text:
Now topbar mobile grid at <=620. Replace `.topbar { gap: 8px 10px; padding: 8px 10px; }` with grid. Need ensure children grid areas. At 620:
```
.topbar {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;
  grid-template-areas: "brand stats tools" "day actions actions";
  align-items:center;
  gap: 7px 10px;
  padding: 8px 10px;
}
.brand{grid-area:brand}
.top-stats{grid-area:stats; justify-self:end}
.top-tools{grid-area:tools}
.day-block{grid-area:day; flex-direction:row; align-items:baseline; gap:4px; border:0; padding:0}
.actions-block{grid-area:actions; flex-direction:row; align-items:center; justify-content:flex-end; gap:8px; min-width:0}
.actions-label{...}
```
But day-block currently order:3; order irrelevant in grid. The day block has .eyebrow hidden and .day-number. Set flex-direction row. The border-left/right from base need reset (at <=900 border-left:0, but border-right still from base). Set border:0.

Actions-block at <=900 order 4, min-width 96. Override min-width 0. The actions-label span hidden, b shown. With flex-direction row, label b and pips side by side. But label has span hidden, b "7". We want maybe show "AP" small. Could add CSS `actions-label b::after { content:" AP"; font-size... }` but not needed. Pips plus number is clear. We'll make it row: b then pips. `actions-label` is a flex with span hidden and b; width auto.

Top stats cash chip. Rep hidden at <=1020. Good.

At <=620, brand-text small hidden; brand width ~35+8+70=113. cash ~70. tools 73. total 256 fits 370. Row 2: day ~40, actions 82 -> fits.

Also sticky topbar height ~90. Fine.

Need also `top-stats { margin-left:0 }` from <=900. Good. Set `justify-self:end`.

Let's edit.

